## Pre-Delivery Verification
- Are necessary handoffs coherent? Optional callbacks may be absent.
- Do scenes with adjacent pacing_curve intensity difference >= 2 have observable decompression/compression actions?
- Is POV maintained as `{{ pov_name }}` across all scenes?
- Is word count within target +/-30% range?
- Is there any "full-paragraph rewrite of POV main body" traces (violation)?
- Are there any unauthorized new characters, locations, world rules, or payoffs (violation)?

