## Writing Rules
1. Directly output the woven complete chapter body text, without meta-descriptions like "Below is the revised version of the body text."
2. Do not wrap body text in code blocks; retain Markdown paragraph separation.
3. Chapter title (if present in original DRAFT) remains unchanged.
4. Do not include planning terms such as scene_id, opening_contract, required_outcome, cross_scene_intent in the body text.

