## Self-Check List
- Full text word count is within `{{ render_word_constraint_self_check(chapter.target_word_count | default(target_word_count | default(0))) }}` range.
- POV is always `{{ pov_name }}` with no mid-way switching.
- Necessary handoffs are realized through actions and consequences; optional callbacks have no coverage quota.
- Transitional paragraph count <= scene count x 2 (prevent transitions from devouring body text).
- No planning terms, report terms, or system metanarrative words appear.
